WEBVTT

1
00:00:07,760 --> 00:00:09,630
hello hello

2
00:00:10,110 --> 00:00:11,630
Are you Huang Yan’s family member?

3
00:00:12,230 --> 00:00:14,030
I saw you coming out of Huang Yan's floor

4
00:00:14,270 --> 00:00:15,630
I haven't seen you before

5
